# iOS Simulator Testing

MCP: `ios-simulator`. Skill: `.cursor/skills/ios-simulator-testing/SKILL.md`.

## When to Run

After changes to `apps/mobile/` screens, components, navigation, or accessibility:

1. Run package unit tests first (`packages/chess-core`, `heatmap`, etc.)
2. `cd apps/mobile && npx expo start --ios`
3. MCP: `get_booted_sim_id` → `ui_describe_all` → interact → `screenshot`

## Accessibility (required for MCP)

Every `Pressable`, `TextInput`, and icon button needs:
- `accessibilityLabel` — stable string for `ui_find_element`
- `accessibilityRole` — `button`, `text`, `header`, etc.

Test IDs alone are not enough — MCP searches AXLabel.

## Bundle

`com.mindboard.app` — use `launch_app` with `terminate_running: true` for cold-start onboarding tests.
